<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-19T03:43:48.459Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:43:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli tanks have crossed the Yellow Line into central Gaza and launched a ground operation, while Israeli forces killed three Palestinians in a fresh Gaza push and an airstrike hit Nasser Hospital, killing six. In the West Bank, Israeli settlers shot a 72‑year-old Palestinian woman near a newly established outpost, and Israel delayed building contracts for a settlement after sanctions on construction firms. Israel also used a video of swimming in Gaza to downplay winter hardships for civilians. The conflict has caused 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/18/israeli-tanks-cross-yellow-line-boundary-into-hamas-controlled-central-gaza&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/world/asia/myanmar-rohingya-muslim-genocide-world-court.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/18/israel-construction-contracts-e1-west-bank-settlement-uk-sanctions&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168796&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/19/icj-to-rule-on-rohingya-genocide-case-against-myanmar?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNc213TmNzNlNLcGt2SlVHc0FaZWM4UWxVSmZEb3VlcS1tRVNMTTBFbEUxZHZ2Q3RqWUEtbGJLY09QYTFyWTM2cFNNS0h3eUFqazd0ZGpuZXpiZWVWd3haRG0tQTBfWFNMSWU1Wk42dlV5WlhiTmk5VE03cTlyWmJ6N0RRaVRWRzZ3LS12czN2OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http